{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Short Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swan Song is a cozy and emotional puzzle game. Use notes of different shapes and sizes to program a music box and solve each puzzle. Help the swan reach the exit as you uncover a touching story of family, loss and grief.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/f537ed481e3413a0b51719382dfdc206.poster.avif?t=1772008215\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/f537ed481e3413a0b51719382dfdc206.webm?t=1772008215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/f537ed481e3413a0b51719382dfdc206.mp4?t=1772008215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How does it work?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is a piece of music waiting to be written. Place musical notes on your scale. Their position determines which platforms activate when the melody plays. Once you\u2019ve composed your solution, turn the key and let the music guide the swan through the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect timing and thoughtful placement are the keys to success. Between puzzles, a touching narrative slowly unfolds, revealing the story of the music box\u2019s creator and the family it was made for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/1b0beaa68afaa8df561c6aebd8b4c1c5.poster.avif?t=1772008215\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/1b0beaa68afaa8df561c6aebd8b4c1c5.webm?t=1772008215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/1b0beaa68afaa8df561c6aebd8b4c1c5.mp4?t=1772008215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You discover an old, mysterious music box filled with personal artifacts. This was the creator\u2019s final masterpiece,\u00a0his \u201cswan song\u201d. Lovingly crafted as a tribute to his family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every puzzle you solve, fragments of his story come to light. What happened to the family? What secrets does the box hold? Let the music lead you through a story of grief, memories &amp; regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/65ff33b80f3a022d9c9cf88408cc8650.poster.avif?t=1772008215\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/65ff33b80f3a022d9c9cf88408cc8650.webm?t=1772008215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/65ff33b80f3a022d9c9cf88408cc8650.mp4?t=1772008215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3265290?t=1772008215","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/f5f4dc486c67588a6f7a4cb63e7ba582b788e8d9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772008215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/bf600665f05398294faeb1f9a3639ca991e2ef30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772008215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/bf600665f05398294faeb1f9a3639ca991e2ef30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772008215","c